.TH "nvme_init_get_features_rate_limiting" 9 "nvme_init_get_features_rate_limiting" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_features_rate_limiting \- Initialize passthru command for Get Features - Rate Limiting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_features_rate_limiting
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "enum nvme_get_features_sel sel "  ","
.BI "__u8 target "  ","
.BI "__u16 tid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_rate_limiting_data *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select which type of attribute to return,
see \fIenum nvme_get_features_sel\fP
.IP "target" 12
Target of the rate limits setting, see
\fIenum nvme_rate_limiting_target\fP
.IP "tid" 12
Target Identifier for the target specified by \fItarget\fP
.IP "data" 12
Buffer to receive the Rate Limiting data buffer, see
\fIstruct nvme_rate_limiting_data\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_RATE_LIMITING
